m-e1d4977a-c138-4773-a762-a87da2df5921" facs="#m-21da9ee5-60db-45a2-bfb5-621ac287dda6" label="ambiguous">JULY 24</l><l xml:id="m-8fc7ac6c-b973-44ee-821b-ebb09cca23eb" facs="#m-88b32ce8-9700-4e0f-b815-5d3bb347f93e" label="ambiguous">St. Francis Solano, Confessor</l><l xml:id="m-caca81c8-65d2-44c8-82dd-c4cd70f53d5f" facs="#m-70318932-3b80-4e2f-9e71-c3be457a262e" label="ambiguous">II class</l><l xml:id="m-5cf71575-7696-4bab-982f-e7dad3b31a87" facs="#m-ced54e8f-a69e-4deb-bcb1-42461b6b0b42" label="text-like">In all dioceses of the United States</l><l xml:id="m-67043564-5719-4f87-829c-8277b90c11ee" facs="#m-03db0934-51d7-4e95-8d3d-8380eecf065b" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Os jústi, from the Common, p. 1200, excent:</l><l xml:id="m-da1e69a3-e3a4-4248-b8e7-8cbe0486a2b7" facs="#m-b8481e14-2c25-4e6f-bbc4-aea4f2e89a6b" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-7933b895-0274-41d8-ba3d-c986f03d0f07" facs="#m-4a8960c7-9d8a-4fd3-9305-f286a4d05d26" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui plúrimas Américae nostris avérte; * et in gentes,</l><l xml:id="m-e47932a2-2ef4-4a43-b652-7fe0f194b2db" facs="#m-a7c7203f-97db-4710-aaae-4e913f978226" label="lyrics-like">U gentes per beátum Franci-[quae te non cognovérunt, timó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6c5dde8d-7b74-40aa-9f36-4fb8901a1f38" facs="#m-2eae2278-97da-46d5-a678-9636dd33a420" label="lyrics-like">rem nóminis tui benignus im¬</l><l xml:id="m-96e6427f-a307-4a91-a63e-bbf1aafa8e55" facs="#m-a8f3f4ab-a5f6-4790-8267-cf94c6d087a6" label="lyrics-like">scum ad sinum Ecclésiae perdu¬</l><l xml:id="m-b71a60b7-88fe-43e6-9a2d-07c3a0c62b94" facs="#m-d9b6f043-f30f-4969-8033-ee1e4a1876ad" label="lyrics-like">mitte. Per Dóminum nostrum</l><l xml:id="m-ab7bf56d-e244-4fe4-911e-fe0c4cabde3a" facs="#m-486bb909-656a-4f2e-b318-80189b9c6948" label="lyrics-like">Msti : † ejus méritis et précibus</l><l xml:id="m-5adb32e6-0879-4bfc-a9a9-3cd0adae3308" facs="#m-9fa89951-7337-4336-bbed-43a95ffa64e7" label="lyrics-like">indignatiónem tuam a peccátis Jesum Christum¬</l><l xml:id="m-d2a9b1a4-6759-41e5-9f1e-018cb63e1caa" facs="#m-84f4cf62-a295-480c-b6f6-fa750252a61d" label="ambiguous">Epistle. Corde enim. p. 1305.</l><l xml:id="m-0d9bc81c-2595-4a5f-8ab2-3ed00478b015" facs="#m-09c2e710-2404-41c8-b6a8-b8740968db5d" label="lyrics-like">Gospel. Eúntes in mundum. p. 1310.</l><l xml:id="m-a84e96d5-1319-4d07-b0fd-9f2ffa68dd54" facs="#m-2cb7f8cf-9137-4ca5-bd18-09425d096a1c" label="ambiguous">Secret</l><l xml:id="m-cb519ff0-afa0-46cc-b8c3-8dc08a922b01" facs="#m-a9a2474b-cc80-4687-8a0a-6627b8781c23" label="lyrics-like">Unus, quod tibi offérimus, mereámur ássequi quod pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-b86569be-1822-41b3-960c-bdbd4d6a8121" facs="#m-0b657930-efc7-4211-a344-dcbda0d81412" label="lyrics-like">1L det nobis, quaésumus, om¬</l><l xml:id="m-107aefb9-7c1c-486e-8530-eb52a7a918df" facs="#m-49e546ae-1cf8-4e52-b63c-6ad6da5ed4d1" label="lyrics-like">mittis, interveniénte beáto Fran¬</l><l xml:id="m-08b29e12-083a-4283-9d53-c1b394db05da" facs="#m-467ff11a-3f16-4fa1-956b-00bdb7a12cb4" label="lyrics-like">nipotens Deus, fídei, spei et cisco Confessóre tuo, fac nos</l><l xml:id="m-4825a80a-8daa-45c5-b3c0-d2045bfc03bc" facs="#m-a9bd3fe6-e2cd-41e7-876a-ef84c0817118" label="lyrics-like">caritátis augméntum: et, ut amáre quod praécipis. Per Dũm.</l><l xml:id="m-4416a16a-87b6-4237-84ff-1b12db95212c" facs="#m-8d86b037-4c9c-4c8c-8ba6-4e605b4930e5" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion</l><l xml:id="m-619437fd-59ba-41d3-938d-8ab44b3c5b30" facs="#m-98ba8858-decc-4595-8f26-f2d7790a5d4f" label="lyrics-like">T sumptis, Dómine, reddámur¡ tuo, fac nos tuis semper obedire</l><l xml:id="m-a145dcc4-c12f-49ba-9eeb-d2d00213162a" facs="#m-4e19d741-4d6b-4dac-8cab-af33bb3e1c22" label="lyrics-like">Udigni munéribus: interce- mandátis. Per Dóminum nostrum</l><l xml:id="m-a4a908cf-5525-4517-98d4-32004371c7d4" facs="#m-d0c0a117-ac15-498b-a0e8-3a36ed1621cd" label="lyrics-like">dénte beáto Francisco Confessóre Jesum Christum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
